# Imports & boundaries

- Use path aliases (`@components`, `@hooks`, `@providers`, `@constants`, `@types`, `@utils`)
- Alphabetize imports / members / props (enforced by eslint-plugin-perfectionist; `make lint` auto-fixes)
- Do not import app routes from deep chart internals unnecessarily
- See `AGENTS.md`
